{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2023-02-23 06:00:00', 'title': 'SELF-AWARE SINGLES TAKE STEPS TO BETTER THEMSELVES & THEIR RELATIONSHIPS THIS YEAR', 'text': '93% OF SINGLES SAY SELF-IMPROVEMENT EFFORTS WILL HELP THEM FIND \'THE ONE\' VANCOUVER, BC , FEB. 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ACCORDING TO A NEW SURVEY FROM DATING APP PLENTY OF FISH , SINGLES ARE FOCUSED ON FINDING NEW WAYS TO SHOW UP AS THEIR BEST SELVES, AND, ULTIMATELY, TO MAKE DATING A BETTER, MORE WELCOMING EXPERIENCE. THIS YEAR, BOTH\xa0ROMANTIC LOVE AND SELF-LOVE ARE A PRIORITY, WITH 60% OF SINGLES INVESTED IN IMPROVING THEMSELVES FOR FUTURE RELATIONSHIPS AND 93% BELIEVING THAT THE EFFORTS THEY\'RE MAKING ARE WORKING AND INCREASING THEIR CHANCES OF FINDING "THE ONE.'}